{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/07.-tampilan-informasi-kompleks-(card,-feed,-dan-statistic)","title":"07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic)","slug":"07. tampilan informasi kompleks (card, feed, dan statistic)","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic).md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (`ui card` dan `ui cards`)","id":"1-kartu-konten-multi-elemen-ui-card-dan-ui-cards"},{"depth":3,"text":"Wadah Kelompok Kartu (`ui cards`)","id":"wadah-kelompok-kartu-ui-cards"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Metrik Statistik Angka (`ui statistic` dan `ui statistics`)","id":"2-metrik-statistik-angka-ui-statistic-dan-ui-statistics"},{"depth":3,"text":"Deretan Statistik Terpadu (`ui statistics`)","id":"deretan-statistik-terpadu-ui-statistics"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Linimasa Aktivitas Sosial (`ui feed`)","id":"3-linimasa-aktivitas-sosial-ui-feed"}],"content":"#programming \n\nKategori **Views** dalam Semantic UI menghadirkan pola antarmuka tingkat lanjut untuk menyajikan informasi visual yang kaya, seperti kartu etalase produk, ringkasan indikator kinerja utama (KPI), serta linimasa aktivitas pengguna.\n\n![Pratinjau Katalog Produk Semantic UI](image/praktek_semantic_catalog.png)\n\n## 1. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (`ui card` dan `ui cards`)\n\nKomponen kartu dirancang untuk menyajikan unit informasi terpadu:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui card\">\n  <div class=\"image\">\n    <!-- Pita Promosi Melayang -->\n    <div class=\"ui red ribbon label\">Diskon 20%</div>\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517336714731-489689fd1ca8?w=500\" alt=\"Produk\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <a class=\"header\">Ultrabook Pro 14</a>\n    <div class=\"meta\">\n      <span class=\"date\">Dirilis Oktober 2026</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"description\">\n      Laptop performa tinggi dengan ketahanan baterai sepanjang hari untuk para profesional kreatif.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"extra content\">\n    <span class=\"right floated\">\n      <i class=\"star icon text yellow\"></i>\n      4.9 (128 ulasan)\n    </span>\n    <span>\n      <i class=\"shopping cart icon\"></i>\n      Stok Tersedia\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ui bottom attached primary button\">\n    Beli Sekarang\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Wadah Kelompok Kartu (`ui cards`)\nUntuk menata deretan kartu secara otomatis dengan tinggi yang seragam, bungkus di dalam kontainer `ui cards`. Anda dapat menentukan jumlah kolom per baris serta menambahkan modifier responsif:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui three stackable cards\">\n  <div class=\"ui card\">Kartu 1</div>\n  <div class=\"ui card\">Kartu 2</div>\n  <div class=\"ui card\">Kartu 3</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 2. Metrik Statistik Angka (`ui statistic` dan `ui statistics`)\n\nClass `ui statistic` digunakan untuk menonjolkan angka penting pada dasbor analitik bisnis atau ringkasan capaian:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui statistic\">\n  <div class=\"value\">\n    <i class=\"users icon text blue\"></i> 12.450\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"label\">\n    Pengguna Terdaftar\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Deretan Statistik Terpadu (`ui statistics`)\nMenampilkan beberapa metrik secara berdampingan:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui four statistics segment\">\n  <div class=\"statistic\">\n    <div class=\"value\">Rp 250 Jt</div>\n    <div class=\"label\">Total Omzet</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"statistic\">\n    <div class=\"value\">99.8%</div>\n    <div class=\"label\">Kepuasan Pelanggan</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"statistic\">\n    <div class=\"value\">14 Menit</div>\n    <div class=\"label\">Rata-Rata Respons</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"statistic\">\n    <div class=\"value\">42</div>\n    <div class=\"label\">Proyek Selesai</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\nModifier statistik yang tersedia:\n- Ukuran: `mini`, `tiny`, `small`, `large`, `huge`.\n- Warna: `red`, `orange`, `yellow`, `olive`, `green`, `teal`, `blue`, `violet`, `purple`, `pink`.\n- Format mendatar: `horizontal statistic` (label diletakkan di samping kanan angka).\n\n## 3. Linimasa Aktivitas Sosial (`ui feed`)\n\nKomponen `ui feed` menyajikan daftar kronologis peristiwa yang terjadi di dalam aplikasi (seperti umpan media sosial atau riwayat log audit):\n\n```html\n<div class=\"ui feed\">\n  <div class=\"event\">\n    <div class=\"label\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=100\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"summary\">\n        <a class=\"user\">Aryanda Pratama</a> menambahkan repositori baru ke organisasi\n        <div class=\"date\">3 menit yang lalu</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"extra text\">\n        Modul arsitektur Semantic UI untuk sistem desain berbasis kata semantik.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <a class=\"like\"><i class=\"like icon\"></i> 14 Suka</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"event\">\n    <div class=\"label\">\n      <i class=\"server icon text green\"></i>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"summary\">\n        Node cluster server Jakarta berhasil melakukan pemulihan otomatis\n        <div class=\"date\">1 jam yang lalu</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\nLanjutkan pembelajaran ke modul interaktif: [08. Modul Interaktif JavaScript (Modal, Dropdown, dan Accordion)](08.%20Modul%20Interaktif%20JavaScript%20(Modal,%20Dropdown,%20dan%20Accordion).md).\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:6a1229117f1b3b25ab1b81092db1a983b10ec92a963f1a143952668a81a11672","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/07. Tampilan Informasi Kompleks (Card, Feed, dan Statistic)","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Semantic UI"],"links":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/08.-modul-interaktif-javascript-(modal,-dropdown,-dan-accordion)","title":"08. Modul Interaktif JavaScript (Modal, Dropdown, dan Accordion)","href":"/docs/pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/08.-modul-interaktif-javascript-(modal,-dropdown,-dan-accordion)"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/05_semantic-ui","title":"05_Semantic UI"},{"id":"pemrograman/css/semantic-ui/06.-formulir-dan-validasi-otomatis","title":"06. Formulir dan Validasi Otomatis"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Kategori <strong>Views</strong> dalam Semantic UI menghadirkan pola antarmuka tingkat lanjut untuk menyajikan informasi visual yang kaya, seperti kartu etalase produk, ringkasan indikator kinerja utama (KPI), serta linimasa aktivitas pengguna.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/assets/vault/Pemrograman/CSS/Semantic UI/image/praktek_semantic_catalog.png\" alt=\"Pratinjau Katalog Produk Semantic UI\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"1-kartu-konten-multi-elemen-ui-card-dan-ui-cards\">1. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (<code>ui card</code> dan <code>ui cards</code>)</h2>\n<p>Komponen kartu dirancang untuk menyajikan unit informasi terpadu:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui card\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"image\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Pita Promosi Melayang --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui red ribbon label\"</span>></span>Diskon 20%<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517336714731-489689fd1ca8?w=500\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Produk\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"content\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"header\"</span>></span>Ultrabook Pro 14<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"meta\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"date\"</span>></span>Dirilis Oktober 2026<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"description\"</span>></span>\n      Laptop performa tinggi dengan ketahanan baterai sepanjang hari untuk para profesional kreatif.\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"extra content\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"right floated\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"star icon text yellow\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n      4.9 (128 ulasan)\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"shopping cart icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n      Stok Tersedia\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui bottom attached primary button\"</span>></span>\n    Beli Sekarang\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"wadah-kelompok-kartu-ui-cards\">Wadah Kelompok Kartu (<code>ui cards</code>)</h3>\n<p>Untuk menata deretan kartu secara otomatis dengan tinggi yang seragam, bungkus di dalam kontainer <code>ui cards</code>. Anda dapat menentukan jumlah kolom per baris serta menambahkan modifier responsif:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui three stackable cards\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui card\"</span>></span>Kartu 1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui card\"</span>></span>Kartu 2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui card\"</span>></span>Kartu 3<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-metrik-statistik-angka-ui-statistic-dan-ui-statistics\">2. Metrik Statistik Angka (<code>ui statistic</code> dan <code>ui statistics</code>)</h2>\n<p>Class <code>ui statistic</code> digunakan untuk menonjolkan angka penting pada dasbor analitik bisnis atau ringkasan capaian:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui statistic\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"value\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"users icon text blue\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span> 12.450\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>\n    Pengguna Terdaftar\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"deretan-statistik-terpadu-ui-statistics\">Deretan Statistik Terpadu (<code>ui statistics</code>)</h3>\n<p>Menampilkan beberapa metrik secara berdampingan:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ui four statistics segment\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"statistic\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"value\"</span>></span>Rp 250 Jt<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Total Omzet<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"statistic\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"value\"</span>></span>99.8%<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Kepuasan Pelanggan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"statistic\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"value\"</span>></span>14 Menit<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Rata-Rata Respons<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"statistic\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"value\"</span>></span>42<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Proyek Selesai<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Modifier statistik yang tersedia:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ukuran: <code>mini</code>, <code>tiny</code>, <code>small</code>, <code>large</code>, <code>huge</code>.</li>\n<li>Warna: <code>red</code>, <code>orange</code>, <code>yellow</code>, <code>olive</code>, <code>green</code>, <code>teal</code>, <code>blue</code>, <code>violet</code>, <code>purple</code>, <code>pink</code>.</li>\n<li>Format mendatar: <code>horizontal statistic</code> (label diletakkan di samping kanan angka).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"3-linimasa-aktivitas-sosial-ui-feed\">3. Linimasa Aktivitas Sosial (<code>ui feed</code>)</h2>\n<p>Komponen <code>ui feed</co